# Data (large, non-redistributable)
data/raw/
data/interim/
data/processed/
data/*.zip
# data/CHECKSUMS.txt is deliberately NOT ignored: build spec 2.9 requires it
# committed so a reviewer can verify byte-identical raw inputs.

# Artifacts
# artifacts/narratives/*.json is deliberately NOT ignored: the build spec
# requires the Groq narrator cache to be committed so `make repro` can
# regenerate every narrator/grounding number with no GROQ_API_KEY set.
# artifacts/case_queue.json is deliberately NOT ignored for the same reason
# — it's what lets `make serve` show real cases from a fresh checkout
# without re-running the full feature/train pipeline.
artifacts/*.jsonl
artifacts/*.pickle

# Reports
# reports/*.md and reports/figures/ are deliberately NOT ignored: build spec
# section 4 marks reports/ "generated, committed" — the whole point is that a
# reviewer can see the results without running `make repro` themselves.
# reports/_smoke/ IS ignored: it's synthetic-fixture output, never a reported
# metric (see tests/fixtures/make_fixture.py's own banner).
reports/_smoke/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg

# IDEs
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store

# Environment
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Notebooks (exploration only, not a dependency)
notebooks/.ipynb_checkpoints
notebooks/*.ipynb

# Logs
*.log

# OS
Thumbs.db
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Stale local archives / caches — not source
*.zip
.pytest_cache/
